<!-- Dev-only trials extension for the SWI Bounty Hunter playthrough: never part of a recorded
     episode. Hand-flown M-rung trials (#47, #63): New Game > utility group > an "SWIBH
     trial" start puts Bobby in his ship with a player-owned wing; comm a wingman to spawn an M
     target; md/swibh_trials.xml logs "[swibh-trial]" lines per fight. No autostart, no auto-quit.
     tools/run-trials.ps1 (make trials) installs it, starts X4 and removes it after. See
     tests/game/trials.md.

     It depends on SWI so it loads after it: SWI's libraries/gamestarts.xml does
     <replace sel="//gamestarts">, which would wipe a gamestart added before it, and its
     libraries/loadouts.xml adds the <loadouts> our loadouts go into. -->
